                    {
                        "translation_id": "c1a47920-0a56-43e7-8e0d-ad3a905969dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8c56fea-c1d7-3739-b15b-ec007e667888",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d17c1a6-603c-37b6-98c3-c3b3fe26f046",
                        "source_sense_description": "een afdruk op een oppervlak van een vinger met meestal de unieke, persoonsgebonden figuur...",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fingerabdruck",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Fingerabdruck",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                        "entry_id": "c2ca1343-709a-3ed8-aa94-8bf156bd01c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abdruck der Innenseite einer Fingerkuppe, der das als charakteristisch angesehene Muster des Hautreliefs erkennen lässt (und zur Feststellung der Identität, besonders in der Kriminalistik, ausgewertet werden kann)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d468ba30-f864-48d0-866a-0ee80fc3e55e",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "Seine Fingerabdrücke sind auf der Mordwaffe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e458fcf0-0174-4a04-8d29-a9fa3c80b988",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Overkamp hob die kleine Gerte neben dem Stuhl auf, sah sie zwischen zwei Fingern kurz an, so wie er Hunderte solcher Sachen anzusehen pflegte, vorsichtig, um keine Fingerabdruecke zu verwischen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76789c7f-4523-4c80-9934-6c017f22d72b",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Er hat vor 30 Jahren etwas verbrochen, man weiß aber nicht genau was, und da wird wohl noch weiter was geschehen, man ist nie sicher bei die Brüder, und jetzt wollen wir von ihm einen Fingerabdruck machen und sein Längenmaß bestimmen, und am besten ihn vorher fassen, man führe ihn uns vor, trari trara.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcb1a44c-7685-45ff-afc2-e48d67c213d6",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Sie messen, nehmen Fingerabdrücke usw.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bce9354-e1df-4a34-aa3c-28b3937d6380",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Die wesentliche Schwierigkeit bei der Untersuchung der Echtheit von literarischen Werken besteht darin, daß man in den Texten nicht so leicht etwas findet, das die Rolle des Fingerabdrucks in der Kriminalistik spielen könnte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05137f6a-e3c8-4005-9939-2ef2b201ed24",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Auch die Scheiben, die er an Stelle der zerschmissenen eingesetzt hatte, zeigten schon Streifen; er hatte nicht einmal seine kittigen Fingerabdrücke abgewischt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8abbe4f9-399c-47c3-9df7-cc24c222aabd",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Fasse die Platten behutsam an den Seiten an, damit du sie nicht mit Fingerabdrücken verunzierst!“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "499b6707-b35f-43ce-a731-92ddd3659472",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Die Fingernägel seiner rechten Hand waren schwarz gerändert, Briefe und Manuskripte, die über seinen Schreibtisch gegangen waren, hatten schwarze Fingerabdrücke und Aschespuren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e45a1dc6-ee0a-40a5-a1d7-0da828bf8434",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Die Polizei hat Fingerabdrücke genommen, Bad und Kinderzimmer vermessen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99e7bb38-c4fd-43d0-b59b-cfa2c1c1068a",
                                                "sense_id": "a8d68221-4497-38c6-8009-17b9bf68fa49",
                                                "text": "„Die Weltraumaffen ätzen sich mit Lauge ihre Fingerabdrücke weg.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "931f9dcd-a4f9-43c2-b18e-ec9b18871fe6",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8c56fea-c1d7-3739-b15b-ec007e667888",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d17c1a6-603c-37b6-98c3-c3b3fe26f046",
                        "source_sense_description": "een afdruk op een oppervlak van een vinger met meestal de unieke, persoonsgebonden figuur...",
                        "target_lang_word": "fingerprint",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fingerprint",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f935a43-a5c2-3afe-9e74-20d178dddd02",
                                        "entry_id": "8ee83669-a66e-30a7-aa73-a0fbaad0561c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The natural pattern of ridges on the tips of human fingers, unique to each individual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9fd16da-5a4c-3c23-adf8-873a83eb464b",
                                        "entry_id": "8ee83669-a66e-30a7-aa73-a0fbaad0561c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The patterns left on surfaces where uncovered fingertips have touched, especially as used to identify the person who touched the surface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "763b6586-d8f3-4111-acad-c991687ae9c1",
                                                "sense_id": "c9fd16da-5a4c-3c23-adf8-873a83eb464b",
                                                "text": "Nervously, he wiped the gun of fingerprints real and imaginary with the stocking-covered fingers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33524b86-8913-4da0-8871-6ea988ad6538",
                                                "sense_id": "c9fd16da-5a4c-3c23-adf8-873a83eb464b",
                                                "text": "The crime scene investigator has the responsibility of collecting latent fingerprints."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6785b726-0cc5-3d70-a592-17dcd9773503",
                                        "entry_id": "8ee83669-a66e-30a7-aa73-a0fbaad0561c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unique combination of features that serves as an identification of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0c4d0d6-0e60-4de9-b8e2-1fc5a8d751a2",
                                                "sense_id": "6785b726-0cc5-3d70-a592-17dcd9773503",
                                                "text": "acoustic fingerprint"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97d4cb17-3435-43ea-bd79-1d57c95332ae",
                                                "sense_id": "6785b726-0cc5-3d70-a592-17dcd9773503",
                                                "text": "Most pharmacopoeial monographs of medicinal plants include TLC as method for identification based on a chromatographic fingerprint, which consists of a sequence of characteristic substance zones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0232474-b205-41fb-b5e2-48fae4648333",
                                                "sense_id": "6785b726-0cc5-3d70-a592-17dcd9773503",
                                                "text": "The set of all location fingerprints and coordinates constitutes the location fingerprint database."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3769b12e-6ffd-31df-81bc-4a923732cf6d",
                                        "entry_id": "8ee83669-a66e-30a7-aa73-a0fbaad0561c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unique identification for a public key in asymmetric cryptography."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b579cf7-185c-3ca9-b644-82c0cc0a28e5",
                                        "entry_id": "8ee83669-a66e-30a7-aa73-a0fbaad0561c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trace that gives evidence of someone's involvement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3795cb0-4e9c-4533-9224-6521fffa3d12",
                                                "sense_id": "6b579cf7-185c-3ca9-b644-82c0cc0a28e5",
                                                "text": "And continue to ask yourself the question, could the incredible complexity of the human body with its multitudinous specialized functions have come into being completely by chance or is it another fingerprint of God?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fingerprint",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d69528bf-d193-39e3-bf39-1eb98ab3248d",
                                        "entry_id": "7a417955-4f6c-3004-a3e0-8e9d0a5cfebc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take somebody's fingerprints."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf75d3a0-0f77-4c3a-b232-9ed3d583cb37",
                                                "sense_id": "d69528bf-d193-39e3-bf39-1eb98ab3248d",
                                                "text": "The jail staff fingerprints its inmates routinely"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5017bfce-998b-47a9-bae5-0eeded9c2417",
                                                "sense_id": "d69528bf-d193-39e3-bf39-1eb98ab3248d",
                                                "text": "Too often, the union says, farmers feel the police response is inadequate and the sentencing too lenient. It’s a view seemingly shared by one of the latest victims of bee rustling, Norfolk bee keeper Simon Greenwood, who told the Observer that police had taken some photos of the scene, fingerprinted a can and then sent him a letter to say no further action was being taken."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3816c63e-f299-3677-8631-8f385b2a0123",
                                        "entry_id": "7a417955-4f6c-3004-a3e0-8e9d0a5cfebc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To identify something uniquely by a combination of measurements."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69e8475b-abb0-4196-9cd6-4554cd57c85b",
                                                "sense_id": "3816c63e-f299-3677-8631-8f385b2a0123",
                                                "text": "Analytical results from this combination of leach tests are tools that allow the investigator to quantify (fingerprint) which geochemical components could be expected in runoff from these piles if they were leached by a cloudburst..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aef32b45-ae37-4d7d-8165-4bbb430208a5",
                                                "sense_id": "3816c63e-f299-3677-8631-8f385b2a0123",
                                                "text": "A significant disadvantage of DNA fingerprinting that excludes conventional methods of population genetic analysis is an absence of genetic interpretation of hybridization fragment origin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8696b4c8-a4f3-44ab-b6c8-660b5fb8fda7",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8c56fea-c1d7-3739-b15b-ec007e667888",
